  "notes": "Warm parchment (#f5f2eb) page with white 24px-rounded cards and soft shadows; olive green (#5c6b48) as the selection/brand accent. Emoji are used as all icons (scenario glyphs, flags in selects, mode icons, theme toggle). Serif Libre Baskerville headings give a storybook 'quest' feel against rounded Nunito UI. Distinctive dashed-border buttons (Source in olive, Deploy to Cloud Run in Google blue). The deploy panel mimics a macOS terminal window with red/yellow/green traffic-light dots and a monospace '> Deploy Your Own Version' prompt. Difficulty pills color-coded green/amber/orange/red (Easy/Medium/Hard/Expert). Clicking a card navigates to a voice session screen with back arrow and language pair chip."
